names.tsv.gz: arcade set names, descriptions, years and manufacturers

Source: the machine list (mameNNNNlx.zip) published with each MAME release,
https://github.com/mamedev/mame/releases. The MAME version is recorded on the
first line of the file. scripts/arcadenames regenerates it from that list and
is the preferred form for modifying it.

Only the fields named above are taken, for runnable arcade machines. They
come from the machine definitions in MAME's driver sources.

